@page "/grid/static"
@using Vibe.UI.Compatibility.WebApp.Client.Grid

@* The first grid has no render mode: it is rendered once, on the server, and nothing follows.
   It keeps no page, and it does not count as a user of its name. The second is interactive
   and under the same name as the first: counted together, neither would keep a page. So the
   second still starts with its own prerendered page. *@
<PageTitle>A grid on a static page, beside an interactive one</PageTitle>

<PartsGrid Mode="static" Label="Static" />

<PartsGrid Mode="beside" Label="Beside" @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
